  "id": "gender-identity",
  "term": "gender identity",
  "definition": "Gender identity is a person’s inner sense of their own gender, such as male and masculine, female and feminine, or ambivalent. It reflects the internal experience of gender role and may be shaped in part by physical traits, parental responses, and psychological and social influences.",
